    "production_notes": "Slow ghost-folk/trip-hop, Felt-dampened upright piano, sparse brushed drums, deep muted bass, distant ticking clocks, floorboard creaks, large empty-room reverb, Minimal guitar harmonics and bowed textures, Long silences between phrases, Arrangement feels like walking through an abandoned house, Final section adds faint harmonies, then recedes into room tone,",
